@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title CryptoPay — State Machine Diagram: Payment
hide empty description
[*] --> PENDING : merchant creates payment
PENDING --> CONFIRMING : customer submits tx_hash
PENDING --> EXPIRED : 30 min passed\n[no transaction]
PENDING --> CANCELED : merchant cancels
CONFIRMING --> CONFIRMING : refresh\n[not mined / not enough confirmations]
CONFIRMING --> PAID : tx valid and confirmed
CONFIRMING --> FAILED : wrong receiver /\namount too low / reverted
PAID --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELED --> [*]
note right of PAID : webhook "payment.paid"
note right of FAILED : webhook "payment.failed"
note left of EXPIRED : webhook "payment.expired"
note left of CANCELED : webhook "payment.canceled"
@enduml
